    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2005-02-06/05-01#art_18> .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2005-02-06/05-01#art_18_obligation_0_fd0dc301_role_e127260f27> a dznorm:Role ;
